      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "0fc0c881ed718598187528a5deb1ba6b11d6c95a349c6d54aa8542e57bb40756"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "From Equation 8.35, the sampling variances and covariances of the two parameter estimates, $ \\widehat{\\mu}_{0} $ and $ \\widehat{\\alpha}_{1}^{c} $, are given by the elements of the $ (2 \\times 2) $ covariance matrix",
      "source_page": 232,
      "printed_page": 212,
